	(text "5 V rail comes from PS1 (HLK-10M05, 5 V / 2 A) on the root sheet.\nU30 TPS562201: 5 V -> 3.3 V synchronous buck, 580 kHz, 2 A. Vout = 0.768 V x (1 + R330/R331) = 3.32 V.\nU31 LD1117S12: 3.3 V -> 1.2 V LDO for the SSD1963 core/PLL (VDDD, VDDPLL).\nLayout: C330/C331 at U30 VIN pin, C332 (VBST) next to the IC, L30/C333/C334 loop tight, FB divider close to VFB, no copper under L30 on inner layers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2903f72-06a3-4b76-976e-93a86bfa1ecb")
	)
